{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2021-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1638316800, "end_date": 1638921599, "month_true_total": 2413, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:45:30 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "105435645", "author": {"steamid": "76561198292113648", "personaname": "TommyTuesday", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198292113648/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 16037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10323, "last_played": 1768739514, "avatar": "d2531aa7d98e0f92a271d80ed8fba0048d0a7527"}, "language": "english", "review": "The beginning of this game when you just start gives you so much freedom, you begin completing quests to get new items and rewards for your next run, every time you play the game you get a little further and it keeps compelling you to move forward. Though, nearing the end of the game it starts to get a little stale, when you have unlocked all of the items and the characters, there's not much you feel you can do, mods are a great solution to this but even they can get a little stale too. This game could have been a 5/5 but instead I'm going to have to agree that it is a\n4/5 great game.", "timestamp_created": 1638920940, "timestamp_updated": 1638920940, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105435636", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039405924", "personaname": "Wped", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WPED/", "num_games_owned": 762, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1488, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review